!Sample_molecule_ch1 = polyA RNA
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = Tissue optimization was performed on one representative MIBC sample from the cohort used in this study, and the optimal permeabilization time was determined to be 24 minutes. Then 4 samples were cryosectioned at 10mm and processed according to the 10x Visium protocol.
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = Libraries were constructed according to the 10x Visium library construction protocol and sequenced by Illumina to a sequencing saturation of approximately 90%.
!Sample_description = Visium spatial transcriptomics of MIBC tissue
!Sample_data_processing = Samples were processed with SpaceRanger (10X genomics, v1.1.0) using the same pre-mrna reference as for the snSeq data analysis to improve consistency between the two datasets.
!Sample_data_processing = Genome_build: GRCh38
!Sample_data_processing = Supplementary_files_format_and_content: combined_visium.h5ad contains processed data for all spots passing QC filtering. These files contain raw counts for every gene in every spot as well as metadata such as sample identity. A1,B1,C1, and D1.jpg are the associated H&E images for each sample.
